The release package (ui.zip) contains Retro's own code (src/) and the
components below. The full source of the DOOM engine (items 1-4) is this
repository at the release's tag: it is built from the pinned upstream
commits, with this repository's patches, by engines/doom/build.sh in the
pinned Emscripten image (emscripten/emsdk:6.0.10). The DOS engine (item 6)
is packed unchanged, as its authors published it; its source is named there.

